# Local runtime state — never committed. The runner creates these on the NAS:
#   KILL_SWITCH      panic stop (touch to halt the fleet)
#   LOOPS_ARMED      the deterministic-class arm flag (ships ABSENT = inert)
#   <loop>.lock/     per-loop single-flight lockdir
#   calls-*-*.txt    per-loop per-day call counters (the call-cap budget brake)
state/*
!state/.gitkeep

# Per-deployment config (caps, ntfy, reel path) — never committed.
.env

# Local event log + reel — runtime, not source.
events/*
!events/.gitkeep
